        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5108C, Cortina Key in Lever with Arched #8 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Cortina Lever with Arched Rosette is a classically styled leverset great for traditional settings. It is available in a huge array of popular finishes including satin nickel, polished brass, and oil rubbed bronze. The Cortina Key in Lever with Arched #8 Rosette is a great way to add extra security to your doors--making it the perfect way to lock your office or closet. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while a dummy lever is just for looks and does not latch nor lock. This drop-tail door lever will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Cortina Lever with #8 Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5108C-specifications.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 5108C Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
