                "title": "Keyed Cortina Lever with Arched Rosette",
                "description": "The Keyed Cortina Lever with Arched Rosette is a classically styled leverset great for traditional settings. It is available in a huge array of popular finishes including satin nickel, polished brass, and oil rubbed bronze. The Cortina Key in Lever with Arched #8 Rosette is a great way to add extra security to your doors--making it the perfect way to lock your office or closet. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while a dummy lever is just for looks and does not latch nor lock. This drop-tail door lever will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.",
